WEBVTT

00:00:02.283 --> 00:00:08.068
Namaste. Is video mein hum The Ray ke wo pages dekhenge jo aapke customers dekhte hain.

00:00:08.068 --> 00:00:13.188
Ye public demo dummy data par based hai. The Ray sirf staff ke liye nahi hai.

00:00:13.188 --> 00:00:20.237
Customer ke liye bhi alag pages hain: booking, catalogue, QR se order, self check in aur repair ka status.

00:00:20.237 --> 00:00:23.894
Inke liye customer ko na login chahiye na app download.

00:00:24.276 --> 00:00:30.149
Pehle Salon ka online booking page. Ye link salon apne WhatsApp ya Instagram par daalta hai.

00:00:30.149 --> 00:00:32.830
Customer ko upar agle saat din milte hain.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:42.151
Ek din chunta hai aur neeche khali time ke slot dikhte hain, jo salon ke kaam ke ghante aur pehle se hui booking ke hisaab se apne aap bante hain.

00:00:42.151 --> 00:00:48.407
Kyun? Kyunki customer raat ko bhi khud booking kar leta hai, aur salon ko phone nahi uthana padta.

00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:55.690
Slot chunte hain, aur naam, phone aur kaunsi service, ye likhte hain.

00:00:55.690 --> 00:01:01.710
Confirm booking dabate hi appointment ban gayi. Ab hum salon ke owner ki taraf dekhte hain.

00:01:01.710 --> 00:01:07.531
Dekhiye, ye nayi booking Appointments mein aa gayi hai, customer ke naam ke saath. Kyun?

00:01:07.531 --> 00:01:12.096
Kyunki customer aur dukaan ke beech ka pura kaam apne aap chalta hai.

00:01:16.646 --> 00:01:18.474
Aisa hi Clinic ka booking page.

00:01:18.474 --> 00:01:24.902
Patient apne doctor ke naam, degree aur photo ke saath booking page dekhta hai, aur khali slot chun leta hai.

00:01:24.902 --> 00:01:25.197
Kyun?

00:01:25.197 --> 00:01:32.097
Kyunki clinic ka reception subah se shaam tak phone par busy rehta hai, aur booking link us bojh ko kam kar deta hai.

00:01:32.457 --> 00:01:40.343
Ab Grocery ka catalogue. Ye dukaan ka online menu hai. Upar banner: Free home delivery paanch sau se upar.

00:01:40.343 --> 00:01:48.229
Search, categories, aur har item par Add. Customer do items jodta hai, aur neeche total ke saath Checkout.

00:01:48.229 --> 00:01:55.668
Kyun? Kyunki customer ghar se hi order de sakta hai, aur dukaan ko phone par list likhni nahi padti.

00:01:57.849 --> 00:02:04.262
Checkout par customer apna naam, mobile aur delivery ka address likhta hai, aur Send order dabata hai.

00:02:04.262 --> 00:02:11.869
Ab wapas dukaan ke owner ki taraf: Catalog orders mein ye order Pending mein aa gaya, items, quantity aur total ke saath.

00:02:11.869 --> 00:02:16.522
Owner ek tap mein Accept and bill dabata hai, aur bill ban jata hai. Kyun?

00:02:16.522 --> 00:02:20.860
Kyunki online order aur counter bill ek hi jagah ka hisaab hote hain.

00:02:21.225 --> 00:02:27.017
Restaurant ka catalogue bhi wahi hai. Menu ki dishes category ke hisaab se, aur order online.

00:02:27.017 --> 00:02:31.625
Restaurant apna menu ka link Instagram par ya WhatsApp par daal sakta hai.

00:02:31.625 --> 00:02:36.047
Aur menu ka P D F, jiski har dish ek link hai, isi se bandta hai. Kyun?

00:02:36.047 --> 00:02:43.396
Kyunki delivery aur takeaway ke orders seedha aapke apne app mein aate hain, kisi aggregator ka commission kaate bina.

00:02:43.770 --> 00:02:48.252
Aur Restaurant ka QR ordering page. Har table par ek QR chipka hota hai.

00:02:48.252 --> 00:02:53.978
Guest apne phone se scan karta hai, menu dekhta hai, dishes chunta hai aur order bhejta hai.

00:02:53.978 --> 00:02:57.775
Order seedha us table ke naam se kitchen tak jaata hai. Kyun?

00:02:57.775 --> 00:03:02.941
Kyunki waiter ka intezar nahi karna padta, aur rush mein bhi order jaldi milta hai.

00:03:04.821 --> 00:03:10.219
Gym ka self check in kiosk. Entrance par ek tablet ya phone, jisme sirf ek keypad.

00:03:10.219 --> 00:03:15.946
Member apna mobile number dabata hai aur Check In. Hum ek member ka number dabate hain.

00:03:15.946 --> 00:03:20.883
Dekhiye, check in ho gaya aur uski membership ki halat bhi dikh gayi. Kyun?

00:03:20.883 --> 00:03:27.992
Kyunki reception par line nahi lagti, aur jiski membership khatam ho gayi hai use turant pata chal jata hai.

00:03:32.677 --> 00:03:40.014
Repair ka job status page. Jab customer apna phone ya A C repair ke liye deta hai, use ek link milta hai.

00:03:40.014 --> 00:03:46.723
Usse kholkar wo dekh sakta hai ki uska device kis stage par hai: received, in progress ya ready.

00:03:46.723 --> 00:03:48.750
Login ki zaroorat nahi. Kyun?

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:55.528
Kyunki baar baar phone karke poochna dono ke liye pareshani hai, aur ye link usse bacha leta hai.

00:03:56.381 --> 00:03:58.750
Aur grocery ka customer khata statement.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:06.332
Customer ko apna udhaar ka hisaab is link par dikhta hai: kitna baaki hai, kaunse bill se, aur sidha U P I se Pay now ka button.

00:04:06.332 --> 00:04:06.628
Kyun?

00:04:06.628 --> 00:04:14.032
Kyunki jab customer khud apna hisaab dekhta hai aur ek tap mein chuka sakta hai, to vasooli asaan ho jaati hai aur bahes kam.

00:04:21.425 --> 00:04:35.857
Aaj humne wo pages dekhe jo aapke customer dekhte hain: salon aur clinic ki online booking, grocery aur restaurant ka catalogue, table ka QR ordering, gym ka self check in, repair ka job status, aur udhaar ka khata statement.

00:04:35.857 --> 00:04:41.822
Ye sab staff ke kaam ko badhate nahi, kam karte hain, kyunki customer khud kaam kar leta hai.

00:04:41.822 --> 00:04:48.493
Ek practical baat: apna booking ya catalogue ka link Instagram bio aur WhatsApp status par zaroor lagao.

00:04:48.493 --> 00:04:51.636
Wahi aapki dukaan ka 24 ghante khula darwaza hai.
